{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は音楽の日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ガールズルール」\n「裸足でSummer」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2曲披露しました。\n観てくださったかなー？\nガルルは新衣装、新曲は初披露！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/07/16/8003343/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなひめ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日楽屋で席隣だったから\nノリでいっぱい写メ撮った♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガルルで着た新衣装は\nスポーティーな感じのテイストで\nお袖がかわいいんですよ～(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして初披露だった「裸足でSummer」\n帰ったら夜の部録画失敗してて\n一人で撃沈しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/07/16/8003343/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌割一緒の3人♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この3人の組み合わせ、何かの曲で\n聞き覚えがありませんか？ふふ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌番組の生放送、久々で緊張した～\n改めてみんなのこと尊敬しました\n私も早く慣れなきゃな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれ以上に\nとっても楽しかったですo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てくださった皆さん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜の夜は、らじらー！サンデー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のゲストは声優アーツに上坂すみれさん\n乃木坂から堀未央奈ちゃんの登場です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募集中のメールテーマは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◯未央ちゃんへの応援メッセージ\n◯中元、自撮り中にそんなこと考えてたの？\n◯RAPで教えてNOGIZAKA CHAN\n◯乃木リンピック\n◯嫉妬台詞対決"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待ちしてまーす(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おたよりの宛先はこちら\nhttp://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんのにのうで～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/07/16/8003343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱくっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/07/16/8003343/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～お知らせ～\n雑誌\n7/19 MONOQLO\n7/23 UTB\n7/23 Samurai ELO\n7/23 smart\n7/25 ミューズクリップ\n7/30 月刊エンタメ\n8/6 TopYell"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVE・TV\n7/17 サマンサタバサレディーストーナメント\n7/18 FNSうたの夏まつり\n7/25 NHKホール 歌番組公開収録\n7/27 高校生クイズ 全国一斉大会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リリース\n7/27 15th single「裸足でSummer」\n8/5 2nd写真集「1時間遅れのI love you.」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/07/16/8003343/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲の衣装も好きー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はサマンサさんのゴルフイベントです\n行くよって方はよろしくお願いします\nらじらーも聞いてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん\nお誕生日おめでとう！(フライング)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}